{"metadata":{"name":"Muwatta Malik","section":{"8":"Prayer in Congregation"},"section_detail":{"8":{"hadithnumber_first":287,"hadithnumber_last":325,"arabicnumber_first":287,"arabicnumber_last":325,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":314,"arabicnumber":314,"text":"وحدثني عن مالك، عن داود بن الحصين، عن ابن يربوع المخزومي، انه قال سمعت زيد بن ثابت، يقول الصلاة الوسطى صلاة الظهر","grades":[{"name":"Salim al-Hilali","grade":"Mauquf Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":8,"hadith":28}}]}